hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 창업/경영/법무/세무/특허 등 전문가 멘토링 지원</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 창업교육 및 Teaching, Coaching, Consulting 지원</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(※ 창업활동 평가성적 미달, 운영규정 미준수자에 대한 중도탈락)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #364878 2.55pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 24.53pt; BACKGROUND: #514bac; HEIGHT: 26.34pt; BORDER-TOP: #364878 2.55pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 4.54pt; HEIGHT: 26.34pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #364878 2.55pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 424.88pt; BACKGROUND: #e3f4e3; HEIGHT: 26.34pt; BORDER-TOP: #364878 2.55pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">세부일정</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTO